{"id": "3092424", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3092424", "title": "ATP Lyon Open 2024 \u2013 Dublu", "text": "ATP Lyon Open 2024 \u2013 Dublu a avut oc \u00een a doua jum\u0103tate a lunii mai 2024. \u0218aisprezece perechi de juc\u0103tori s-au \u00eenscris \u00een competi\u021bia de dublu a turneului de tenis de la Lyon, Fran\u021ba, jucat pe terenuri cu zgur\u0103, \u00een aer liber. Rajeev Ram \u0219i Joe Salisbury au fost campionii en-titre, dar s-au retras \u00eenainte de \u00eenceperea turneului.\nHarri Heli\u00f6vaara \u0219i Henry Patten au c\u00e2\u0219tigat titlul la dublu la turneul ATP Lyon Open 2024, \u00eenving\u00e2ndu-i \u00een final\u0103 pe Yuki Bhambri \u0219i Albano Olivetti, cu 3\u20136, 7\u20136(7\u20134), [10\u20138]. Heli\u00f6vaara \u0219i Patten au salvat un punct de meci \u00een final\u0103."}
